8nYoNBPpORilAIVq2kDL1jSa9r\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pBQQIIZM69xEm8Q8VDkeWxg54gfHgaPSW9Ucy3f0BK_-fodTn-ECzgnIlKgNKwdLtoI8ObkHVOfUwa22t7k-SSg\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VN3YXfvYgrUFVJ8iDugRO8OipkRbYul5KZcOyIYiqYRSE6Fi_Fqa-gt2HUgYWslXgZZUj4YwM4-NjU0F8vmlcA\"]]],\"Mini Fidget Antistress Games\",[\"4.2\",4.19],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tvf.anti.stress.relaxing.mini.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.tvf.anti.stress.relaxing.mini.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.tvf.anti.stress.relaxing.mini.games\"]],[\"qgJ3GnUIAEoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCSQotCidjb20udHZmLmFudGkuc3RyZXNzLnJlbGF4aW5nLm1pbmkuZ2FtZXMQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Take a satisfying break with Mini Fidget Antistress Games, a colorful collection of 45+ relaxing mini games, virtual fidget toys, ASMR games, drawing games, emoji puzzles, brain games, and quick challenges. Pop bubbles, spin a fidget spinner, peel stickers, play with slime, crack virtual glass, draw missing parts, match emojis, and discover a new way to play whenever your mood changes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eONE GAME, MANY WAYS TO PLAY\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMove freely between antistress games, satisfying games, puzzle games, fidget games, drawing games, matching games, and light skill challenges. Every activity is easy to start, whether you want a peaceful break, playful sensory fun, a clever brain puzzle, or a quick test of timing and control.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFIDGET AND POP IT FUN\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore interactive fidget toys including Pop It, Shape Pop It, Bubble Up, Fidget Spinner, Pendulum, Newton’s Cradle, and Music Speaker. Tap, spin, pop, press, plug and move each toy to discover responsive visual effects. Fans of pop it toys and virtual fidget games can quickly choose a favorite and start playing.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eSATISFYING ASMR ACTIVITIES\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy Sticker Peel, Slime, Glass Crack, Stamp It, Blackboard, and Light Bulb activities. These satisfying ASMR games focus on taps, peels, pops, smooth movement, and playful visual feedback. Try slime games, create patterns, peel stickers, and make cracks appear across a virtual glass screen.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDRAWING, EMOJI, AND BRAIN PUZZLES\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink, draw, match, and solve with creative drawing puzzle games:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Draw One Part – Study each picture, understand what is missing, and draw the part needed to complete the scene.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Draw to Crush – Draw a useful line or shape, use gravity and physics, and crush the target to complete the level.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Emoji Match – Connect related emojis, discover clever associations, and solve colorful emoji puzzles.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChange the pace with Tile Puzzle Block, Flip Card, and Tic-Tac-Toe. These brain games and logic puzzles combine observation, memory, creativity, and simple problem-solving. Whether you enjoy drawing puzzles, physics puzzles, emoji games, matching games, or classic puzzles, there is always something different to try.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eQUICK SKILL CHALLENGES\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTest your timing, aim, and control in Knife Hit, Tap Tap Shots, Snooker, Gyroballs, Pong Ball, and Insect Swat. Choose a calm activity when you want to unwind, or try a quick challenge when you want more action.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWHY YOU’LL ENJOY IT\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• 45+ relaxing mini games and interactive activities\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fidget toys, satisfying games, drawing games, emoji games, and puzzles in one collection\\u003cbr\\u003e• Draw One Part, Draw to Crush, Emoji Match, Pop It, slime, and more\\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple tap, swipe, drag, draw, match, and tilt controls\\u003cbr\\u003e• Colorful visuals with clear and responsive interactions\\u003cbr\\u003e• Short activities that fit easily into your day\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you are searching for relaxing games, stress relief games, or anxiety relief activities, choose the type of casual play that suits your mood. Explore pop it toys, fidget play, satisfying ASMR activities, drawing puzzles, emoji matching, casual games, and quick challenges in one varied collection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePick an activity and start popping, spinning, peeling, drawing, matching, tapping, aiming, or solving.\"],\"The Fashion Valley\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8L6KbrNl_S-6S8yXXEOYzwrBfoOY6fCJX57GLkle8lTKtr58-6WNHKZqz8bXwxnGb2Mx_SquKHIzQ7ZlhNg\"],null,[91,42,22,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.co