Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fashion.dress.up\"]],[\"qgJeGlwIBEoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMAoaChRjb20uZmFzaGlvbi5kcmVzcy51cBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Doll Dress Up: Fashion Star, the ultimate fashion playground where your creativity knows no bounds! Design, collect, and battle with your dream dolls in a world of endless style possibilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ UNLIMITED DRESS UP\\u003cbr\\u003eNo limits, just pure fashion! Customize your dolls from scratch. Select different genders, diverse skin tones, glamorous makeup, and hundreds of clothing concepts. Style without boundaries and build a magnificent collection of unique dolls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 CHOOSE LEFT OR RIGHT: THE STYLE DUEL!\\u003cbr\\u003ePut your style instincts to the test in our signature fashion battle! Go head-to-head against other players, let the system score your look, and see who claims the title of Style Queen or King!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e• No limits: Total freedom over gender, skin, and makeup 💄\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun Left or Right decision-making gameplay 💖\\u003cbr\\u003e• A vast collection of styles to unlock and master 👗\\u003cbr\\u003e• Exciting automated scoring system to crown the winner 🏆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and win the duel!\"],\"CozyTap Studio\",\"10,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VIHqAFmPoTSePQe9WorqXrvh81sfN9-C8pVeyTREqDV2Tk9hjAGkUBQN0tB50L6lh0cYIb8_FfUpO9C9QmnE\"],null,[247,179,235,255]],nul