l always keep fresh content to help you feel calm and relieve anxiety.    So, what are you waiting for?    Download this game now to calm your mind, get rid of stress and improve your quality of life!\"],\"SUPERIOR  STUDIO\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jtRILpDhrYcXUQxnwFxjh5CGro1j2H6v8CxDVf_KtIkB2YE4GgzBcuoW4J9A9Xl0nE9gJnrqsxzQW4IzxO6lSA\"],null,[127,73,35,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.yg.mini.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.yg.mini.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$6.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.king.candycrushsaga\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UnJeAEhtjxDyRdwv2steMYn-AeiV1pJ_COfsqNGy9xBqF9LWtCHGU_k51K7rOecvk-Y591tmW_ZrlO3W7Sbg\"],null,[252,2,1,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1280