NDT1bKGlEqs6Losp_zV4dq9B9a17-9qPVmAmraXSYPaaxb7G8pshL8USieaLjavKxl9ag\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tfe_ekcQdVw65dfIex3POSS0knklbqJtaUfKmXP-yLjzTFTaMolSP9WB1Bn6Gp7IYnbDthF3ehyKmd69Lfzx0U4\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/u4CIVmM8tu6gwmsB3fb910rFcHlESKcwEyGJEgL9zTOiPbWrtQiFdVETM995_gHCvru2Jm7WCDSkDwTfroi2\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m2PFuomJ9PNCn3MaLbFG1ZkZZu53Niwo0El_HcB7GeUCDKqpwY2jw9GqFFUSOzaie8MqIwpTfdYcaUK5vZX4Bw\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/n3d6Ny1wm3drrsnq4C0fuv6o_Axg3zMuFdEzrh2jjGMWSwGZ28ndg1MR0Reb4o7wADBAFoPCSpytZTBYAum6Bg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1bD-fK0bZtz4MmL_iNDT1bKGlEqs6Losp_zV4dq9B9a17-9qPVmAmraXSYPaaxb7G8pshL8USieaLjavKxl9ag\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tfe_ekcQdVw65dfIex3POSS0knklbqJtaUfKmXP-yLjzTFTaMolSP9WB1Bn6Gp7IYnbDthF3ehyKmd69Lfzx0U4\"]]],\"Mini relax games-No wifi\",[\"3.5\",3.4545455],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.jgame.relaxgames\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.jgame.relaxgames\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.jgame.relaxgames\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIE0oTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgoaChRjb20uamdhbWUucmVsYXhnYW1lcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🎮 Fun. Fast. Totally Addictive. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re looking to de-stress, kill time, or just laugh out loud — this collection brings the internet’s favorite games into one wild and hilarious app. \\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Key Features: \\u003cbr\\u003eTons of viral \\u0026amp; satisfying mini games  \\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for quick play \\u0026amp; short sessions  \\u003cbr\\u003eFunny and unexpected gameplay mechanics  \\u003cbr\\u003eNo Wi-Fi needed — play anywhere!  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSurprises, randomness, and laughs in every tap  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 What’s Inside? \\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Instant Stress Relief \\u003cbr\\u003eSmash, slice, twist, and relax with satisfying games like:  \\u003cbr\\u003ePop the Bubbles  \\u003cbr\\u003eUnscrew the Screws  \\u003cbr\\u003eSlice the Soap \\u003cbr\\u003eEvery tap helps calm your mind and brings that “ahh” moment.  \\u003cbr\\u003e🚽 Find the Toilet?! \\u003cbr\\u003eTime is ticking — and nature is calling! Help characters navigate hilarious obstacle courses to reach the toilet in time. It’s weird, wild, and totally addictive.  \\u003cbr\\u003e✍️ Draw the Line, Save the Day \\u003cbr\\u003eUse your finger to draw lines and solve puzzles! From Save the Dog to Fill the Cup with Water, your drawings will shape how each level plays out.  \\u003cbr\\u003e🍉 Juicy Puzzle Madness \\u003cbr\\u003eMerge fruits in the viral Big Watermelon Challenge or swipe your way through colorful tile puzzles. It’s all about strategy… and juicy chaos!  \\u003cbr\\u003e🌀 Oddly Satisfying Gadgets \\u003cbr\\u003eSpin a Fidget Spinner, pop a Stress Button, or watch objects react in strange and funny ways. Short, looping games perfect for your coffee break.  \\u003cbr\\u003e✅ Why You’ll Love It \\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to play, hard to stop  \\u003cbr\\u003eFun for kids, adults, and everyone in between  \\u003cbr\\u003eBursting with personality, memes, and chaos  \\u003cbr\\u003eGreat when you’re bored, waiting, or avoiding responsibilities  \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Download now and jump into the most unpredictable collection of mini games ever. \\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re drawing, smashing, merging or rushing to the bathroom — every tap is a good time!\"],\"JMGame\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/f4j_YyDqQ2kcG-lnGv-cY5a5JkOg23KjQmEiEpeCblAF9nQgkLZXs5MDcJxq9gYBH--CZYl1ev7vMy9fFF5VJA\"],null,[39,4,77,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.jgame.relaxgames\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.jgame.relaxgames\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$3.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.markettrainingvpgame.moneytycoon\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7vjfntCkyMwhGGRsGe4eH7DwXLwCKnghXR1jSgmxMIEr14hcTOS-kWGaMFFuPhWFwlVtJkE6WPysSa1quqU5jQ\"],null,[4,12,9,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2796,1290],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yMRC6YtySSKTXKGCi0asoMYhoz8Rau96z8-B65CujVWKFfF2bmO2xbSIn6kiDQTeYuFUh