\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UUmhKG9wkQQvvpm39sfA8SUTqF7G5t8TaEFlSkMcCOLUp4jw6kVvqPEE431nCJwjvyNVmdOYYqmA9REWg88VTA\"]],[null,2,[2796,1290],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Opra8lyrn-BW5yr1_jwnXy5cKLHgE9LWYz2JqfoCjSijRfHnHW0guOmf90xE8Ij4Q9U9sK9sgu6RvwWpfDYoSpE\"]],[null,2,[2269,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8Tm1fIH13o15yXD33aAmQLd-Dc6jtkq0CSHo6DdsnDbr0C5lNCnPBGs-4btNL-oQI3QOzR2QVGBWntNVR37wiA\"]],[null,2,[2258,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sE2axcQkEgBBZZ8I4yZVfDQYcqfJW2lycMZtOO0jsZJqLz2QXnZQBQ1KeQhXSwxyYDlxfnUdrVMVtG_NaM-VPw\"]]],\"Money Tycoon Profit Tap\",[\"4.3\",4.277228],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.markettrainingvpgame.moneytycoon\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.markettrainingvpgame.moneytycoon\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.markettrainingvpgame.moneytycoon\"]],[\"qgJ0GnIIFEoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRgoqCiRjb20ubWFya2V0dHJhaW5pbmd2cGdhbWUubW9uZXl0eWNvb24QARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Build your business empire in the exciting economic clicker simulator Money Tycoon Profit Tap!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you dream of becoming a virtual tycoon, managing huge corporations, and growing your own business? Welcome to Money Tycoon Profit Tap—a new casual clicker and economic strategy game where every tap brings you closer to the status of an in-game billionaire! Go from owning a small startup to heading a global financial network in this ultimate life and business simulator.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur economic business simulator Money Tycoon Profit Tap offers unique gameplay that combines elements of a classic tycoon, clicker, and full-scale management. Tap the screen, collect virtual coins, upgrade enterprises, and unlock new industries!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnique Mechanics for Each Business\\u003cbr\\u003eIn the game Money Tycoon Profit Tap, you do not just upgrade abstract numbers. You will manage six completely different industries, each featuring its own unique game logic and mechanics:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Your Own Store: Manage retail trade, optimize the product assortment, attract virtual shoppers, and increase the virtual cash register turnover.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Taxi Service: Create your own fleet! Set up passenger transport logistics, upgrade cars, and hire virtual drivers to automate gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Logistics and Delivery: Upgrade transport hubs, coordinate cargo traffic, and deliver valuable goods across the game world.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Construction Company: Erect residential areas and commercial properties. Manage construction equipment and develop the metropolis infrastructure.\\u003cbr\\u003e- International Airport: A real aviation tycoon! Coordinate domestic and international flights, purchase passenger planes, and upgrade terminals.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Industrial Factory: Launch automated production lines, process resources, and manufacture unique products.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVirtual Investments and Deposits\\u003cbr\\u003eBecome an experienced game investor in the world of Money Tycoon Profit Tap! Manage your accumulated virtual capital wisely\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDynamic World: Events Every Minute!\\u003cbr\\u003eThe world of our business simulator is constantly changing. Every minute, random events happen in the game that directly affect the operation of your enterprises!\\u003cbr\\u003eBe ready to adapt to virtual economic booms, shifts in demand, market trends, and unexpected situations. Your manager intuition will face a real test!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLuxury Life of a Virtual Billionaire\\u003cbr\\u003eLevel up your game character and spend your earned virtual millions on luxury lifestyle items:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect an exclusive fleet of supercars and elite automobiles.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Purchase private jets and ocean yachts to travel across the game map.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Invest in rare art pieces, paintings, and antiques to highlight your high status on the leaderboard.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMini-Games and Daily Tasks\\u003cbr\\u003eThere is no room for boredom! In between managing your business empire, you can expect:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unique Quests and Tasks: Complete interesting missions with engaging in-game storylines.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Diverse Mini-Games: Test your reaction speed, logic, and luck in mini-games with completely different mechanics.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Daily Quests: Log into the game every day, complete daily task chains, and claim valuable bonuses and boosters to accelerate your progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple and intuitive gameplay: the perfect blend of an idle clicker and economic strategy.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Offline play capability: your game empire continues to develop even when you are not online.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Colorful graphics, a stylish user interface, and pleasant sound design.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Completely free-to-play simulator game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDisclaimer: The Money Tycoon Profit Tap app is a simulator game. All mentions of money, currency, investments, income, and deposits refer exclusively to virtual gameplay and have no connection to real financial operations, payouts, or real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake the right strategic decisions, develop your management skills, tap the screen, and become the most successful virtual tycoon! Download the economic clicker Money Tycoon Profit Tap right now and start building your empire!\"],\"Market training VP game\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mimw5pkdFllJkvLTdrPLG6LebhInjz_xvPyPViNzUAYE5GvZJcvRok5cJ1gQzLo7xy7UvcYdBz5MRloLvXc2UQ\"],null,[229,235,231,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.markettrainingvpgame.moneytycoon\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.markettrainingvpgame.moneytycoon\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.outfit7.mytalkingangelafree\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/y-rPtQnej2b1qvJTob4mUlje5KfPxb8OTlX3STNobBo6uCGAvHOU36Zlo4gPXboZqr4R2Krv7qJwivFkE8lQfg\"],null,[247,111,158,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gSygn2EcO0AMTo7cAz0Pr6JS9V5yN7TueWAQUq3ofwFiBm0eeg-zD4P8KC1ynFLIdge2ckq-ArVDngfA_9da\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Jt