 MASTER\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Swipe to avoid obstacles\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Run, slide, and accelerate on icy roads\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Push opponents and block their path\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Stay ahead and win the snow race\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Simple controls make it easy to start, but only skilled runners can dominate every battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧊 GAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Exciting Snow Races – every level brings new challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ Battle Runner Gameplay – compete directly against other runners\\u003cbr\\u003e❄️ Icy Tracks \\u0026amp; Snow Maps – slippery roads, traps, and surprises\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Colorful Characters – fun visuals with competitive action\\u003cbr\\u003e📴 Offline Play Supported – enjoy anytime, anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ Fast \\u0026amp; Casual Gameplay – perfect for short play sessions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 PERFECT FOR PLAYERS WHO LOVE\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Runner games \\u0026amp; racing games\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Snow race and ice race challenges\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Casual battle games\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Quick, fun, and addictive gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e_ Suitable for all ages, easy to learn but endlessly entertaining.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📲 DOWNLOAD NOW!\\u003cbr\\u003eThe icy battlefield is waiting.\\u003cbr\\u003eWill you outrun everyone… or slip and fall behind?\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Download Ice Runner Battle: Snow Race now and prove you’re the fastest runner on ice!\"],\"Dongbasiki\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ox9Y1_QHkgwH_1iHWIe_F3YcL-8B7g7hqnHNphuiV9gc9tOOlHBQAa5JQrze39eoQB9nlXCpINZmIrcZWkTDng\"],null,[233,240,248,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u0