 wisely - their lineage holds the key to victory.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHighlighted Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Brand new level experience with multiple choices\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play One-Handed to dominate the continent!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unveil the mysteries and experience various strategic gameplays\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect and match, unravel the mysteries of the void\\u003cbr\\u003e- Strengthen your power, and form alliances with others to receive the greatest support!\"],\"Glaciers Game\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GMu3Xd0ey5lbVYOm7Sn8EUVzX_Y5S3nbK4VJy7jcCbP-gjrMwjynpW1ghloOCIiV836P7frpq8zzvEQ2Gz1G\"],null,[151,212,91,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.xman.sea.gp\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.xman.sea.gp\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"$0.99 - $99.99 per item\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,nu