, a vibrant reel adventure inspired by the African savanna. Spin the reels and encounter iconic animals, ancient treasures, and hidden surprises waiting to be revealed. Every moment brings new excitement as the wild meets timeless mystery.\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features\\u003cbr\\u003eSavanna Adventure Theme: A colorful journey with rhinos, lions, elephants, cheetahs, and other majestic animals.\\u003cbr\\u003eDynamic Reel: Smooth spinning action combined with vivid visuals and polished effects.\\u003cbr\\u003eImmersive Visuals and Sound: High quality art style with bright colors and energetic music that set the atmosphere.\\u003cbr\\u003eQuick and Easy Play: Suitable for short casual sessions.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether drawn to the roar of the wild or the mysteries of ancient treasures, Wild Roller: Relic Treasure delivers an engaging reel game experience filled with charm, color, and excitement. Explore, spin, and enjoy the journey through the heart of the savanna.\"],\"MS TAKENGON\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kgCiDknlzKuXJksGXnp6lya909_6rgGihKvBh_kiwZvJv4LAWjc_KfMu-X_heJ6rklBFPRo7lzn4hsDHykvWfQ\"],null,[125,214,81,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Prominent Gambling Imagery\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/stIOCymv1bYIi3UU_owFeyNt30CkUXbNlDj81ZWtjW9NBIMJxI47i_psYIr0Ho430Rm6mByCGNLORloB\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dc