\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSimple to Start, Tough to Master\\u003cbr\\u003eGetting started is effortless – learn the controls in seconds and jump straight into the action.\\u003cbr\\u003eBut true mastery? That’s where the fun begins. Every level is packed with clever twists and hidden strategies that will push your skills to the limit.\\u003cbr\\u003eYou’ll never run out of things to try – existing levels get frequent updates, and brand-new indie mini games drop in regularly to keep the adventure alive.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’ve got two minutes or two hours, there’s always a challenge waiting. Play casually to unwind or push yourself to beat your own records – the choice is yours.\"],\"Play Stove\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_OmQcxjT8uwrC-qIrEy_oC6Tm73V5EheziFf2v1IK3szTPfnCN6THeHy9RQSNwDGauGjbPQliiOhtawTx2zU\"],null,[238,238,234,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Sexual Innuendo\"],[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ps.running.mini.games.challenge\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ps.running.mini.games.challenge\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,