o explore various tasty food, ingredients, recipes from all over the world in the frenzy free cooking games for adults. Now you can dash it as a krusty cook-off challenge in your favorite cooking game - Happy Cooking!  Cook \\u0026amp; serve delicious meals in this frenzy of free cooking games madness from all across the world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e♥Become the best culinary master in exciting FREE time management games  \\u0026amp; frenzy cooking games for free! Enjoy the cooking fever time with your fingers, and cooking madness in worldwide restaurants. Serves dishes like a Crazy Chef! Experience kitchen fever in hot time-management cooking games! Now for free! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e♥Cook and serve tasty food in cooking games! Prepare, cook, and serve tasty food in the cooking world! Grill cheeseburgers or baking pizza…Explore joy Cafe, bakery shop, and many other restaurants. Dash from kitchens in diner time! Master massive menus and become a crazy star chef in our food game!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e♥\\u003cb\\u003eTAP, COOK, SERVE!  Anytime, Anywhere!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Cooking games offline, one of the best dash cooking games free without wifi. \\u003cbr\\u003e- Enjoy time-management cooking games anytime.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Create your own Kitchen chef cooking journey story.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e♥\\u003cb\\u003eCook 100+ Tasty Food\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hundreds of delicious ingredients to cook for meals.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Burgers, hotdog, sushi and barbecue...Cook dishes that you have never seen before.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Upgrade ingredients to manage top cooking restaurants!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e♥\\u003cb\\u003eChallenging 200+ levels make you become the COOKING MASTER\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- New tasks \\u0026amp; missions, Hundreds of levels, become the star master chef!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hundreds of delicious ingredients to cook for meals.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fry, Bake, Boil, Steam, Simmer and Grill magical ingredients to make worldwide food for cooking fever!.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e♥\\u003cb\\u003eVarious Challenges and Targets\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e- Manage time efficiently with kitchen appliances upgrades.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Manage your time to cook tasty food and do not burn them!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Upgrade the kitchen \\u0026amp;  ingredients to manage the fun cooking restaurant games!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlock new habits to improve your life \\u0026amp; time management games skills!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e♥Play the cooking game NOW! A FREE restaurant game with fast-paced gameplay and strategy and simulation fun. Record ur cooking story and cooking diary, and enjoy cooking fever! Experience kitchen fever in hot time-management cooking games! Now for free! Have fun with cooking games and don’t hesitate to share this cooking games with your friends!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e☕️Twitter：https://twitter.com/JoynowStudio\\u003cbr\\u003e☕️Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Happy-Cooking-Chef-Fever-1979090235720073/?modal\\u003dadmin_todo_tour\\u003cbr\\u003e☕️Support E-mail：jwu898@163.com\"],\"Joynow Studio\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LnOOrlNnWGx-hFwu1SPtQqDwDgIAfNyTtZGfygLzGImEYQ7pMqyJHr-QurdhBgpQhJ3hnzkmuJE46WVd6jtf\"],null,[186,77,48,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"Digital Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgam