es\",[\"4.1\",4.07],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bubbleshooter.popbubbles.shootbubblesgame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bubbleshooter.popbubbles.shootbubblesgame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bubbleshooter.popbubbles.shootbubblesgame\"]],[\"qgJ9GnsIN0oTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCTwozCi1jb20uYnViYmxlc2hvb3Rlci5wb3BidWJibGVzLnNob290YnViYmxlc2dhbWUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"npfxxsxj_ho\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:npfxxsxj_ho?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:npfxxsxj_ho\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznA3PJ9WhTCVg3LWQAyhUZuDdDoVcjURnz28aCNrmmddgojA4aZ0zmnC9y8U19BVNh8sUSdqG-rjtLRKn-DvR8vqALQMbUBe_vQYxcwr3Gixp9ADCNjtZmmfrPc4P5oDdBGj5c1c1iY2DreljfJrlXWBoE0hFIV8_1cjVdQUi2uXlbwEpaSJhdiojfEjmBkxBDUJLsLHbTCw-Apryhs5HObrcYUfc_re0TVuAOhyBhLwof0HpRE11tUFjmo8Ku-OulcmYvKHg65VSMrEOLk2zkDzVFkgXSuE6KO1tSIlk8F5w\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/npfxxsxj_ho/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Shoot Bubble, classical bubble shooter game and poping all bubbles in each level.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you know how to crush bubbles?  \\u003cbr\\u003eFind the bubbles of the same color, aim and shoot, you can eliminate all bubbles on the field. \\u003cbr\\u003eIt is simple and easy to learn and quickly get started. There is no network requirement. \\u003cbr\\u003eYou\\u0026#39;ll be addticed to shooting bubbles anytime and anywhere, suitable for players of any age.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to enter the paradise of Bubble Shooter?\\u003cbr\\u003eOn the basis of the classic bubble gameplay, Shoot Bubble has many innovative gameplay, rich elimination gameplay and interesting crushing rules are waiting for you to discover. It has so many surprise activities to add color to your adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAMEPLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e* Classic bubble elimination\\u003cbr\\u003eLaunch the bubbles through the aiming line, more than 3 bubbles of the same color can trigger the smashing effect, which is simple and easy to learn.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* Innovative gameplay with powerful props\\u003cbr\\u003eThere are also many fun and powerful props. Using props reasonably can help you pass the level faster.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e* Interesting activities\\u003cbr\\u003ePass the levels, become the champion, and get the richest rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAME FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e- 3000+ fun and interesting levels, continuously updated\\u003cbr\\u003e- Distinctive element design and new gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- Dynamic decompression of crushing sounds and effects\\u003cbr\\u003e- Rich daily rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fun activities give you a different experience\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect special items and stay first\\u003cbr\\u003e- Continuous elimination to obtain powerful props\\u003cbr\\u003e- Challenge the champion to win the biggest reward\\u003cbr\\u003e- No internet required, you can play anytime, anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGot Feedback?\\u003cbr\\u003eWe’d love to hear from you! Contact us at help@ivymobile.com with any issues or suggestions during the pop bubbles game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShoot Bubble, a casual game suitable for all ages and can be played in any environment, come and enjoy the leisure time.\"],\"Ivy\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YFuLmc6_07I_q2AwQ_WPGvy96QNYtP48tzEofjhE0LRHgDOZwdnWjVnTOxO3GP7p8PbhffRH7STdlyiV1mTN4A\"],null,[3,54,232,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4