m.jc.flowermatch.tiles.puzzlegame\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.jc.flowermatch.tiles.puzzlegame\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.jc.flowermatch.tiles.puzzlegame\"]],[\"qgJzGnEIOUoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRQopCiNjb20uamMuZmxvd2VybWF0Y2gudGlsZXMucHV6emxlZ2FtZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to your peaceful floral puzzle journey! 🌸 Step into a gentle world filled with blooming petals and vibrant flower tiles, where every match brings calm and joy 💐\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy simple and soothing tile matching gameplay designed to relax your mind. 🧘 Collect 3 identical flower tiles to eliminate - watch lovely blossoms bloom across the screen and solve laid-back puzzles at your own steady pace! 🌹 Explore countless beautifully crafted stages full of unique flower designs. 🎨 New puzzles unlock constantly, bringing fresh visual charm and light strategic fun each time you play. 🌷\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌿 Game Features 🌿\\u003cbr\\u003e• Calming Gameplay 🕊️: Play without timers, take your time to match tiles and enjoy every serene moment\\u003cbr\\u003e• Gorgeous Floral Art 🖼️: Designed blossom tiles and vibrant natural colors create a superb visual experience\\u003cbr\\u003e• Soothing Audio 🎵: Gentle background music and tender sound effects build a warm relaxing atmosphere\\u003cbr\\u003e• Rich Levels 📜: Hundreds of blooming puzzle stages with regular updates for endless leisurely fun\\u003cbr\\u003e• Handy Boosters ✨: Unlock props to clear tricky tiles and keep your garden growing bright\\u003cbr\\u003e• Offline Friendly 📶: Play anytime anywhere even without an internet connection\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis is a flower puzzle game for players of all ages! 👨\\u200d👩\\u200d👧\\u200d👦 Start your floral journey and develop a small quiet garden you ca