ame.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis relaxing renovation simulator blends satisfying cleaning games with the soothing sounds of ASMR, letting you remodel, redecorate, and design a cozy space step by step.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003ePeel away worn wallpaper and enjoy satisfying house cleaning game effects.\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on fun home renovation tasks and careful fixing of furniture.\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy the makeover process and create a warm home through creative decoration across different rooms.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHome Makeover – Features\\u003cbr\\u003eFix and remodel interiors like the roof, walls, and fireplace with smooth controls.\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock new furniture items as you progress and try fresh house design options.\\u003cbr\\u003eExperiment with different sofa styles, décor, and creative layouts to build your dream home.\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience relaxing cleaning gameplay with ASMR effects designed to ease stress.\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into Home Makeover: ASMR Game, perfect for anyone who enjoys house clean games, home renovation, and creative house design. Redecorate every detail, transform the interiors, and even refresh the garden to bring joy back to this home.\"],\"Happy Giggles\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zLo-xJtfMq5KTlLfs1y9ZF4SW4ErNG8ihu9bf86xDCvdIgemg6oFUHO7EPvYVaN0Rq5r_y9PoP55m-pvPwo5HoA\"],null,[167,198,226,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\