ps://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ll7behhGYdrRuQpa5JmoUJoW65mtjIbIY2CpF12vYDiPdm4im9Xodlt5y-sKaZ-o2q7xLxWbhGBlFrNhMozYj8c\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/61wChok-LIwOW77is9-8TPuU92yCFvB4JHAp8ZGv3jJvlXqjZqM3XJj8hQUDaBULC3ufeEv955nH481Acp-U7g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/V-ZRLgw5E6BT7CLbk7863q1oW1adqCougtkH8lknxWMmn7PpIQm5adh5sXu8N5COKOhaKZtIpC0GQn_18O7WKS0\"]],[null,2,[1024,768],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qDihiE825kKbLjw93c8p1K3ZIsTRZiGiBIWlojlf_ZpPY9e1yghYxwXLRsslSNXSLRXyzJ0pUniTHD-MCpPmSw\"]],[null,2,[1024,768],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3cSHYG6pWz_o2sH9TG4CClkJISla9BtxzPJmVOp8FJJk601nGBPAJ_FwhhWcBZ-1Mkxk28ywaa0N1IGq3oDNjA\"]],[null,2,[1024,768],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PiQcjZBLo7tyNJz4HkzralhJYLvjN4l-nJ2afCS1ZoDA8sT59dODmEuneocHJtvLC95-zHzdy-U5z0ydyrXr\"]],[null,2,[1024,768],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hoAI4-_j4tghGuEMbUSf83eIuQi-Vvjrzcdsm3wRhwdXxNP_bl5WWlGwGIlWuTvRJmwOljp-nSsrjtHitkGVhlk\"]],[null,2,[1024,768],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZJiSklmApCmLNDElQAELU1CA9OKtNGRZ3WaKZSqyLD6XAp9b8Ami7SeKJIZFczyTqYvrCVo9TmPiAOWWTVWeTXQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/V-ZRLgw5E6BT7CLbk7863q1oW1adqCougtkH8lknxWMmn7PpIQm5adh5sXu8N5COKOhaKZtIpC0GQn_18O7WKS0\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/61wChok-LIwOW77is9-8TPuU92yCFvB4JHAp8ZGv3jJvlXqjZqM3XJj8hQUDaBULC3ufeEv955nH481Acp-U7g\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ll7behhGYdrRuQpa5JmoUJoW65mtjIbIY2CpF12vYDiPdm4im9Xodlt5y-sKaZ-o2q7xLxWbhGBlFrNhMozYj8c\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kUnEPgOEFIxtZJ8njV9RuoBCEWWjP9HKbCKTgbO4S9feEkkv0kZDQXFrVcU4dHtFraCDkzRCLdJfuIjQ6DT9\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sGzNUycZfbCEQx3fl6Z6W4Rzd9vUu7O2QW1Ba82Jkgd9R3I7RhJo1ex-L29fjsqtdUeu08RZg3HfkAafSmZ8c-Y\"]]],\"Mukbang Star: ASMR Live Collab\",[\"4.2\",4.2222223],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.auragames.mukbang.asmr.live\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.auragames.mukbang.asmr.live\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.auragames.mukbang.asmr.live\"]],[\"qgJvGm0IRkoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQQolCh9jb20uYXVyYWdhbWVzLm11a2JhbmcuYXNtci5saXZlEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Ready for the ultimate crunch? 🍭 Step into the delicious, satisfying world of Mukbang ASMR \\u0026amp; DIY cooking experience!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you love watching viral ASMR videos? Now you can be the star! Dive into a world of crunchy sounds, wiggly jellies, and creative cooking. From crafting the perfect Tanghulu to hosting a Live Stream with millions of fans, your journey to becoming a Mukbang Legend starts here!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 EXPLORE THE TASTIEST MINI-GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock your inner chef and master different food trends:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDIY Tanghulu: Skewer your favourite fruits, coat them in sweet sugar, and hear that famous crunch!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRainbow Jelly Maker: Choose heart, bear, or flower molds! Add glitter, boba pearls, and delicious syrups to create the world\\u0026#39;s wiggliest treats.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSchool Lunch Master: Pack the ultimate lunchbox with nuggets, watermelon, and octopus sausages!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRamen \\u0026amp; Burger Bar: Boil the perfect noodles or stack a massive burger with avocado, bacon, and spicy mayo.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLive Ice Cream: Mix and roll ice cream on a freezing plate for the most satisfying dessert ever!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎥 GO VIRAL \\u0026amp; BECOME A STAR\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s not just about cooking—it’s about the fans!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLive Stream Mode: Start your broadcast and watch the hearts fly! Earn coins and tips from your viewers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCollab with Stars: Matchmake with guest streamers and host a \\u0026quot;Collab Mukbang\\u0026quot; to double your views.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRank Up: Move from a \\u0026quot;Newbie Nibbler\\u0026quot; all the way to a \\u0026quot;Mukbang Legend.\\u0026quot; Can you reach 50 million followers?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🐾 ADORABLE COMPANIONS\\u003cbr\\u003eYou don’t have to eat alone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAdopt cute pets like the Shiba Inu, Red Panda, or the chill Capybara to sit by your side while you stream.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 WHY YOU’LL LOVE IT\\u003cbr\\u003eUltra-Satisfying ASMR: High-quality sounds for eating, boiling, and crunching.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreative Freedom: Thousands of combinations for sauces, toppings, and decorations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStress Relief: The perfect game to relax and unwind with \\u0026quot;oddly satisfying\\u0026quot; gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFree Rewards: Spin the wheel and complete part-time jobs to unlock exclusive ingredients and secret recipes!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mukbang Star now and start your crunchy, wiggly, delicious ASMR adventure today! ✨\"],\"AuraEffects\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bGPn1nP2rmpTB5NE8eU_-gMrM5xPJdLsoztGjLyby_A7kGYFfVjWU44FarBdVbogoqvsHFYrQWjHj28klbSN\"],null,[195,236,234,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[nu