1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J9TV-CA1cSpO7Ql5iubB-ImcBFrwRveMWVx5WxG60DDWRm8FrYNLjF6DJ9oYBG7DIO44plg66jb6MOiav0ly_aI\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-Zzblqy24i54WTExksjnAwhVDiWNp2offiHubkejZ6lQK-gjKfdBBYF0qtQeX_JfRQYqA_vrvjGkVv1QJKdY\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W8l13ESmG7ww7LlrCNRlv2zOu-4Q4g8bKFiKgSHkKYwee03yxbnF0CFtRrmO6s50CZGgU4qVnQohf5CUH1uI3g\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BieMRE0pQVWGAZkC9KVXQPzMTVpnnaXrCrHEEjbratx1jFvD6jtj8MW-ELGwSbT3ODlFH8aL6Mzeaw2MmXpSEQ0\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h8komDwQaGkFB9sYWxRO4WVKSIFs3IXSqISyYFKYqAT8AY7sfRgGvgYNbljjEK5s7PcX_P9gOVAmukPrj2QXKA\"]]],\"Tik Tap Challenge\",[\"3.8\",3.85],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.trending.tik.tap.game.challenge\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.trending.tik.tap.game.challenge\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.trending.tik.tap.game.challenge\"]],[\"qgJzGnEISUoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRQopCiNjb20udHJlbmRpbmcudGlrLnRhcC5nYW1lLmNoYWxsZW5nZRABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Are you ready to take on the most trending game challenge of the moment? Welcome to Tik Tap Challenge – where addictive gameplay meets endless fun!                 \\u003cbr\\u003e                                                       \\u003cbr\\u003eTik Tap Challenge is the perfect blend of trending games and engaging gameplay that will keep you coming back for more. Whether you’re looking to unwind with some anti stress activities or simply have fun, this game is designed to entertain you in every tap.    \\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                    \\u003cbr\\u003eGet ready to dive into a world of exciting challenges! From mastering quick taps to enjoying the soothing sensation of fidget toys, Tik Tap Challenge has it all. With its minimalist graphics, the game offers a visually pleasing experience that is both relaxing and stimulating. Each challenge is crafted to test your reflexes, creativity, and precision, making it the ultimate choice for those who love a good challenge.                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY:                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003e🌟Just tap, tap, tap to conquer each challenge with perfect timing.                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003e🌟Swipe and tap your way through a variety of mini-games, each more exciting than the last.                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Unlock new levels and challenges as you progress, ensuring endless fun.                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003eFEATURES:                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003eTrending games inspired challenges that are perfect for both quick play sessions like 999 cuts, tap game and longer gaming marathons such as defuse the bomb, save the cat, feed him, match correct one,... \\u003cbr\\u003eFidget toys and antistress features integrated into the gameplay for a soothing experience.                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003eMinimalist graphics that provide a clean and simple interface, enhancing your focus on the game.                                                                                                                                         \\u003cbr\\u003eOffline games mode available, so you can enjoy Tik Tap Challenge anytime, anywhere.                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003eWHY TIK TAP CHALLENGE?                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re on public transport, relaxing at home, or taking a break from work, Tik Tap Challenge offers the ultimate escape with its mix of Fun and challenge.                                      \\u003cbr\\u003eThe game is designed with both casual and hardcore gamers in mind, offering a perfect balance of relaxation and excitement. Take the ultimate trending game challenge: 999 cuts, defuse the bomb, save the cat, brush jijaemu cat and more!                                                                       \\u003cbr\\u003e                                                                        \\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to tap your way to victory and become the ultimate champion? Enjoy Tik Tap Challenge now and see how far you can go in this addictively engaging game.\"],\"XGame Global\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Vhmkded1O4TE1lJzhkDe44GojINLd0WQ-tf_wuK735X5O2O4TD5alUCrFi9YdNGiujyfXNOfCGawU7HInt6mIg\"],null,[124,129,250,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-N