VJluVtc7uVsAeX4Wjtz1MCK5r1bkT7oCzo_e3s7oObfxPLSOFArTUvroC_XY4TEbdwNZjppVg\"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/q5B4Y5Jo2-kktJ0argF3oh-oCgCijRo8FL2vj2waypqneSB0OpvWLfNVWBYkHUbrS9ffiA38SWow3PElhCZQ\"]]],\"Nail Salon Makeover Games\",[\"3.6\",3.5555556],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sz.nailsalon.nailart.diy.makeover\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sz.nailsalon.nailart.diy.makeover\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sz.nailsalon.nailart.diy.makeover\"]],[\"qgJ1GnMITEoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCRworCiVjb20uc3oubmFpbHNhbG9uLm5haWxhcnQuZGl5Lm1ha2VvdmVyEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Nail Salon Makeover Games!\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the world of fashion, beauty, creativity and style with one of the most fun and satisfying nail salon games. If you enjoy makeover games, nail polish games and relaxing ASMR sounds, this is your perfect beauty salon adventure. Paint nails, design stylish manicures, and explore the calming vibe of ASMR-satisfying games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💅 Create Stunning Nail Art\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore your creativity with endless options of colors, glitter, crystals, gems and accessories. From DIY nail polish to trendy patterns and stickers, every manicure becomes your masterpiece.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💖 Fun Nail Salon Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s more than a nail salon game; it’s a full makeover challenge! Enjoy manicure, pedicure, and beauty salon tasks. Run and manage your own nail salon, polish nails with unique designs, and make clients happy with dream nail makeovers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing \\u0026amp; Satisfying Experience\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you love ASMR games, this nail salon makeover brings soothing sounds of brushing, polishing, and painting nails. The smooth visuals and gameplay makes it one of the most relaxing and satisfying nail polish games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Endless creative nail art designs\\u003cbr\\u003e• DIY nail art with stylish manicure options\\u003cbr\\u003e• Full salon makeover: manicure \\u0026amp; pedicure fun\\u003cbr\\u003e• Relaxing ASMR \\u0026amp; satisfying gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e• Gems, glitter, stickers \\u0026amp; trendy nail art styles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fashion-inspired beauty and makeover tools\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👉 Download Nail Salon Makeover Games– Nail Art today! Paint, polish, and design nails in the most stylish salon game. Relax, play, and let your imagination shine.\"],\"Sim Zone Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HCn555ikPfz-c-PZR_tgVd8lY0l2Qd4PSz-bJtQkPeCqJs2mSpD0HR_RjmvZ0nUmiUaZcSQmmjOBGHCjg2JWHg\"],null,[217,202,244,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.sz.nailsalon.nailart.diy.makeover\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.sz.na