c943PRhisSbOzlfOo1U-aJpSPboYsM2RwBwdEAzb1WLPZVh8ZWzoMDighKKVx8_4MUSnpg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2v9i0CZPq5So7ny4jwUiNS5tkWkrdibas47ryTaJb11EpNuNMWl9_ud4vOONCC6BN44dXhqzseDb-ujpCwA7Vg\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2EVzDcQYpY03FlaD7gmegJdez0PSyJddCV5wP6kJvijqiNqrkdNn34g8DmJeyDgrBrF8XA6Mm0h1uE9hCdQFwg\"]]],\"Steal Escape: Egg Speed\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.Steal.Escape.Egg.Speed\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.Steal.Escape.Egg.Speed\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.Steal.Escape.Egg.Speed\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIUEoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgogChpjb20uU3RlYWwuRXNjYXBlLkVnZy5TcGVlZBABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"STEAL. RUN. HATCH. REPEAT.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSneak into rival nests, snatch the biggest egg you can carry, and sprint back to your base before the Egg Guards catch you! Steal Escape: Egg Speed is a fast, funny 3D idle-runner where every egg you steal turns into cold hard cash.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY Raid the Egg Nests scattered across the map and grab an egg — the bigger it is, the more valuable the pet inside. Egg Guards are watching, though: wake one up and it\\u0026#39;ll chase you down, so sprint for your Safe Zone before you get caught! Bring your loot home, drop it in your Base, and watch it hatch into an adorable pet that earns you Cash automatically, even while you\\u0026#39;re away.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR EGG EMPIRE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSteal eggs of every size from guarded nests — the riskier the grab, the bigger the reward\\u003cbr\\u003eOutrun Egg Guards and rival players racing for the same loot\\u003cbr\\u003eHatch dozens of unique pets, each one adding to your passive income\\u003cbr\\u003eUpgrade your Base to hold more pets and stack up bigger profits\\u003cbr\\u003eHop on the Treadmill to boost your running speed and out-sprint the competition\\u003cbr\\u003eUnlock flashy Trails to leave your mark while you run\\u003cbr\\u003eWatch out for Night Time — every few minutes the lights go out and it\\u0026#39;s not safe to be caught outside your base\\u003cbr\\u003eCome back anytime to collect Offline Earnings from your growing pet collection\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY YOU\\u0026#39;LL LOVE IT Easy one-thumb controls, a satisfying risk-vs-reward chase, and a pet collection that keeps paying out even when you\\u0026#39;re not playing. Whether you\\u0026#39;re here for the thrill of the steal or the joy of building the ultimate pet farm, Steal Escape: Egg Speed keeps the loop short, snappy, and endlessly replayable.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and start your egg-stealing empire — just watch your back!\"],\"H2T GLOBAL PTE. LTD.\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HjvLCrYqof7ZfBFRmmRia3DwJAfJ2WDIwvtQb9Hr8uihrm36YzEGyzx_7Ur2botWgsgw_slHp-UVs2bs8lasFA\"],null,[55,158,246,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google