-IdQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pQpohXRMF-CqhFaZ7pmGjMrlWxS8Cx28iPnOuNvQokAE7b06crDYzTo1H3G79taAtO5zzr5faH5ZdV3M2IDWbw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fmoe_gCEkRThH1wYBCFKT8O13TB7pUsQa1csfsJldxw0NGjFhySAtUA6rHTX7ih2Yq6_ORydABJSe088C6oVXyM\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3BhqijYqn7Oo-IbnL5ANI29nrqt4D0M24yQsCfV-6d5NKxVT1t7E__JIKUFSc2kzshZe8sqJT3t453jqzvqq\"]]],\"Left or Right: Dress up Show\",[\"4.0\",4],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.amb.fashion.fit.leftright\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.amb.fashion.fit.leftright\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.amb.fashion.fit.leftright\"]],[\"qgJtGmsIVEoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPwojCh1jb20uYW1iLmZhc2hpb24uZml0LmxlZnRyaWdodBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Dive into the vibrant world of fashion with 🎀Left or Right: Dress Up Show🎀, a game designed for trendsetters and style enthusiasts.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to become the ultimate fashion stylist and showcase your style prowess? In Left or Right: Dress Up Show, you will experience an exciting dress-up adventure. Unlike traditional dress-up games, this game offers a unique gameplay mechanic where you choose between two options - left or right - to style your character. Each choice you make will determine the look of your character, from head to toe. Once you\\u0026#39;re done, it\\u0026#39;s time to enter the Dress-up Show and compete against other stylists to see whose outfit is more fashion!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👗 Key Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fashion Gameplay: Choose between left or right options to style your character.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Style Battles: After dressing up your character, compete in exciting fashion battles. Show off your fashion styling skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e-  Explore a vast collection of clothing, accessories, hairstyles, and more. With countless combinations, you can create unique and stunning looks.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Regular Updates: Stay ahead of fashion trends with new outfits and accessories. Whether you prefer casual, party, beach, or wedding styles, this game offers endless possibilities for creative expression.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👠How to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Choose Your Style: Select from various fashion items by picking left or right.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Fashion Showdown: Once you\\u0026#39;ve dressed up your character, enter into fashion battles where you compete. The best-dressed character wins!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to make fashion choices that will captivate the world? Download  🎀Left or Right: Dress Up Show 🎀 today and unleash your inner stylist. Don\\u0026#39;t miss out on the fashion fun – join the style showdown now!\"],\"OAK Adventures Studio\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/izFWdqOjEFAyB-lymAoxlrbDL6SmWcHiiTTxg_cT6RtpPv20Fjk--A-zkbgPVzAAslqE7jd6tnZ5nWSGvcCFZQ\"],null,[247,173,228,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,nu