3.4\",3.4210527],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.happygo.runcollection\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.happygo.runcollection\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.happygo.runcollection\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIVUoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOwofChljb20uaGFwcHlnby5ydW5jb2xsZWN0aW9uEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"A7onrAp_-zE\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:A7onrAp_-zE?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:A7onrAp_-zE\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezmugqBfXMwiMtDoAHWo0amSVaSvrS8fmAItrAurzitGMlfBsDUArdgTnHYFhrnyHNSCTWuWwwRsPIK9IVX2PK3vtVQGNPqMQlvCIL2eEXp-1hZmXAFyBxBAHu0TTWfFB2QAj9L7KZ5_iqtMfxJ_lxPF4SlUrF5ebHnJnXpn2J6CKlIM-EwJC-UAhaipCQgXVgnCwRR4ndWOAniswKwby4bfGGdCbPlSHiWKsXrBq8crZ475dP0Ic8uWDiNYSa768zqpU6X1O4W7g05wXnDb7VysIhr80g2BkX18Qrsg6-ZFSw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A7onrAp_-zE/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"🏃 Welcome to Run Challenge 3D! 🎮\\u003cbr\\u003eA fun 3D parkour game collection filled with exciting running challenges, obstacle courses, and action-packed levels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRun, jump, dodge, and overcome different obstacles in a variety of parkour challenges. Each level brings a new way to test your speed, timing, and reflexes. Whether you enjoy quick casual runs or challenging obstacle courses, you can find a fun experience here.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏃 Diverse Parkour Challenges\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience different types of running gameplay. Avoid obstacles, jump over traps, move through challenging paths, and complete each level with your best skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Simple Controls, Fun Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003eEasy-to-learn controls let you start running instantly. Swipe, tap, and react quickly to avoid obstacles and reach the finish line.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Fast-Paced Running Action\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel the excitement of 3D parkour movement with dynamic obstacles, tricky paths, and satisfying moments as you complete each challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Multiple Mini Games in One App\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy a collection of parkour-inspired challenges with different themes, characters, and gameplay styles. Every run offers a new challenge to complete.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔄 New Challenges Added Regularly\\u003cbr\\u003eKeep playing and discover new levels, obstacles, and parkour experiences through updates.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePerfect for players who enjoy casual running games, obstacle courses, and fast reaction challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Run Challenge 3D and start your parkour adventure today! 🏃\\u200d♂️💨\"],\"Happy Go Game\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QYTD-SbdbSPlb6e0h_YFeBKRWh7tfrE8xe5qdfZrSizT8zhWePwyL8BqD1YCsue0EWjEkWHsmue8toXM1VFKOzE\"],null,[40,159,249,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[nu