HAU1LgbRJEOqMwuDBTtc\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DAfQDVB_Wzp7rx3lFvbx6pvCOnJPrlOj6hwVFeV2lcxKdZxKNak3bLlpXcCxA2cP2928EyOwTuhkhf4GX-RbNA\"]],[null,2,[2560,1440],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e7LseylG3O3xi3rFeBGoW1oXOMstlFczJjkockZfIvX1CkO6PQ1Aymy-X0uYuHnNAt7LyVdjfGrknBGw-S6xow\"]]],\"Little Princess: Fashion Game\",[\"3.4\",3.390244],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.princess.makeup.dress.up.littlegirl\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.princess.makeup.dress.up.littlegirl\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.princess.makeup.dress.up.littlegirl\"]],[\"qgJ3GnUIVkoTCMjrorLHkJcDFX24rAId8gQ7O/oBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCSQotCidjb20ucHJpbmNlc3MubWFrZXVwLmRyZXNzLnVwLmxpdHRsZWdpcmwQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Little Princess: Fashion Game, a magical realm where fashion meets fantasy! Designed for fans of dress-up games and chibi doll avatar creators, this game is a delightful journey into a world of style, competition, and creativity. Whether you\\u0026#39;re a budding fashionista or a lover of all things cute, Little Princess: Fashion Game is your perfect playground. 🌟🎀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn Little Princess: Fashion Game, you\\u0026#39;re not just dressing up a doll; you\\u0026#39;re bringing a character to life with an extensive wardrobe of clothes, accessories, shoes, and dresses. Accompany your stylish creations with adorable pets, adding an extra layer of cuteness to every outfit.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy You\\u0026#39;ll Love Little Princess: Fashion Game:\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Fashion Battles with Other Players: Showcase your style skills by battling it out with other players. May the best fashion creator win!\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Capture Your Creations: Take pictures of your dressed-up dolls and save them to your gallery. Share your designs with friends or keep them as your fashion portfolio.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Special Princess Dresses: Access a collection of special dresses, including princess gowns that will make your doll look like royalty.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Adorable Chibi Graphics: Dive into a game with cute and adorable graphics that will melt your heart with every outfit you create.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Healing Sounds: Enjoy the healing soundtracks that make your dress-up experience even more relaxing and enjoyable.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Be a Doll Avatar Maker: Create your favorite character with a wide range of customization options, bringing your ideal chibi doll to life.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Regular Updates with New Features and Items: Enjoy frequent updates that bring fresh and exciting clothes, accessories, and features to enhance your dress-up experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Fun for All Ages: Little Princess: Fashion Game is a game that\\u0026#39;s suitable for everyone, offering a safe, creative, and fun environment for players of all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re dressing your doll for a fashion battle or creating your dream princess avatar, Little Princess offers a world of creativity and fun at your fingertips. So, are you ready to unleash your inner fashion designer? Download Little Princess now and start your journey into a world where style meets imagination! Dress to impress and let your creativity shine in Little Princess: Fashion Game! Download now and start styling! 👑🎨📱\"],\"kiwilab\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eqwhNu9Sa4urXU9QIcnCwjF8eEd6u63mWlMJZLMb3AoYCiSSQa3BGJEuv-nAT3YAfVr1jl3W3-kdHeE0lswn\"],null,[89,201,247,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8Og